('112.27.b.12.A',4,'Why are there usually fewer top predators than herbivores?','["predators eat only plants", "predators are smaller", "less energy is available at higher levels", "herbivores eat predators"]'::jsonb,2,'The energy pyramid limits numbers.','original'),
('112.27.b.12.A',4,'In which direction do arrows point in a food web diagram?','["from the eater to the eaten", "toward the Sun only", "randomly", "from the organism eaten to the organism that eats it"]'::jsonb,3,'Arrows show energy flow.','original'),
